<title>USA: Heritage Media approves 5 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Heritage Media approves 5 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heritage Media Co said on Monday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to five million Heritage common shares, through open market and private purchases.</p>
<p>The targeted marketing services company has about 35.6 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Heritage Media said because of its strong free cash flow, the buyback would not hamper the company's development plans.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
